WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.800
[Soft music]
Salt Lake Air: air quality and inversion forecasts.

00:03.800 --> 00:08.400
Know what the air is doing right now.
Hawthorne station: AQI 66, moderate.

00:08.400 --> 00:13.200
Good, moderate or bad, it tells you what to do.
AQI 33 good, 66 moderate, 153 unhealthy.

00:13.200 --> 00:16.400
See when it gets better, hour by hour.
Best time outside: 5–7 PM.

00:16.400 --> 00:19.200
Know when there's an inversion.
Active: warm air above is acting like a lid.

00:19.200 --> 00:22.000
And when it clears.
No lid, air is mixing. AQI 33, good.

00:22.000 --> 00:25.200
Pick the UT DAQ station closest to you.

00:25.200 --> 00:27.600
And more: Clearing Index, 3-day outlook, ozone and smoke,
official DAQ forecast, Utah County stations, dark mode,
share links, sources and methods.

00:27.600 --> 00:30.000
Salt Lake Air. Air quality for the Salt Lake and Utah valleys.
